  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "ⲕⲁⲛ ⲉⲣϣⲁⲛⲟⲩⲁ ⲣⲡⲉϥⲁϩⲉ ⲧⲏⲣϥ ϩⲛϩⲉⲛϭⲓⲛⲟⲩⲱⲙ ⲙⲛϩⲉⲛϭⲓⲛⲥⲱ · ⲟⲩⲗⲁⲁⲩ ⲡⲉ ⲛⲛⲁϩⲣⲛⲛⲁⲓⲱⲛ ⲛ**ⲁⲧⲟⲩⲱ** ·",
      "english": "And if any man shall pass the whole of his life in eating at feasts, and in drinking of wine, (that period of time) will be as nothing compared with the ages which shall follow it without end.",
